  "substitutions": [
    "Node standard Promise, Map, Set, Error, URL and URLSearchParams.",
    "Event sink records membership and completion events. Library membership cache is a synthetic Map; Rootlist onUpdateItems executes unchanged with a standard Set.",
    "Native collection/playlist/rootlist services capture semantic arguments and expose manually controlled Promise receipts.",
    "Protobuf fromPartial helpers are structural identity stand-ins. No protobuf bytes, native HTTP fields, codec behavior, account restrictions or live server acknowledgement are established by this execution.",
    "Operation interception returns false so the original mutation path executes; error decoration returns the supplied error."
  ],
  "observations": [
    "Track saving and artist following share LibraryAPI membership updates, emitted synchronously before the native write is awaited.",
    "Unchanged original URI classifiers route artists to collection add/remove and list-platform tracks to playlist Modify.",
    "Rootlist add/remove update cached membership and publish membership before awaiting the rootlist mutation.",
    "Native rejection publishes the previous membership. LibraryAPI rethrows the rejection; RootlistAPI reports it through operation-complete events and resolves its method."
  ],
