    "behavior": "Publish desired membership immediately to all mounted controls; keep normal enabled icons and labels during writes; restore last acknowledged membership on rejection.",
    "concurrency": "Application ownership policy: one serialized write lane per URI, coalescing repeated clicks to the latest desired membership. Pending state and revision checks prevent stale reads from replacing an optimistic update or rollback. These concurrency improvements are not claimed as exact original execution behavior.",
    "lifecycle": "Artist writes belong to the account repository and survive the initiating view being removed. Account disposal cancels the underlying request. Playlist controllers and track controllers retain their existing cancellation ownership.",
    "network": "Existing verified request owners are unchanged. No polling, speculative writes, or extra mutation-status requests are introduced."
  },
